  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1744730349_5202079_26e571136b2a34c60c7454cdf09b2152.png",
  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull;</p>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"175\" data-start=\"146\"><strong data-end=\"173\" data-start=\"150\">Brand Introduction:</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"606\" data-start=\"176\"><em data-end=\"186\" data-start=\"176\">Unbroken</em> is a purpose-driven streetwear brand designed to reflect strength, discipline, and resilience. Operating as a mobile storefront, our business brings high-quality clothing directly to the public &mdash; in parks, on sidewalks, and at community events. More than a fashion label, <em data-end=\"469\" data-start=\"459\">Unbroken</em> is committed to building a community of individuals who live with endurance, push through adversity, and represent an unshakable spirit.</p>\r\n<hr data-end=\"611\" data-start=\"608\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"643\" data-start=\"613\"><strong data-end=\"641\" data-start=\"617\">Product Description:</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"784\" data-start=\"644\">Our product line includes a selection of premium streetwear items designed for both everyday wear and statement impact. Offerings include:</p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"932\" data-start=\"785\">\r\n<li data-end=\"821\" data-start=\"785\">\r\n<p data-end=\"821\" data-start=\"787\">Artistic full-body print hoodies</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"859\" data-start=\"822\">\r\n<p data-end=\"859\" data-start=\"824\">High-quality heavyweight T-shirts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"892\" data-start=\"860\">\r\n<p data-end=\"892\" data-start=\"862\">Branded fleece and outerwear</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"932\" data-start=\"893\">\r\n<p data-end=\"932\" data-start=\"895\">Beanies and caps for year-round use</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-end=\"1060\" data-start=\"934\">Each item is designed with comfort, durability, and message in mind &mdash; appealing to customers who value both style and meaning.</p>\r\n<hr data-end=\"1065\" data-start=\"1062\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1104\" data-start=\"1067\"><strong data-end=\"1102\" data-start=\"1071\">USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"1528\" data-start=\"1105\"><em data-end=\"1115\" data-start=\"1105\">Unbroken</em> sets itself apart through its mobile, face-to-face business model and the message behind the brand. We are not limited to retail space or online platforms &mdash; we engage directly with the public in dynamic environments. Our brand represents the mindset of resilience and endurance, and every item worn is a visible reminder of that commitment. This model builds not only sales but a genuine, values-based community.</p>\r\n<hr data-end=\"1533\" data-start=\"1530\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1559\" data-start=\"1535\"><strong data-end=\"1557\" data-start=\"1539\">Payment Terms:</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"1651\" data-start=\"1560\">We offer straightforward, reliable payment options to accommodate our in-person operations:</p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1690\" data-start=\"1652\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1670\" data-start=\"1652\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1670\" data-start=\"1654\">Bank Transfers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1679\" data-start=\"1671\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1679\" data-start=\"1673\">Cash</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1690\" data-start=\"1680\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1690\" data-start=\"1682\">Checks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-end=\"1803\" data-start=\"1692\">Each purchase is confirmed with a receipt, and all financial exchanges are handled securely and professionally.</p>\r\n<hr data-end=\"1808\" data-start=\"1805\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1838\" data-start=\"1810\"><strong data-end=\"1836\" data-start=\"1814\">Other Information:</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"1969\" data-start=\"1839\"><em data-end=\"1849\" data-start=\"1839\">Unbroken</em> has the potential to grow exponentially with dedication and consistent effort. For example, with a $10 profit per item:</p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"2116\" data-start=\"1970\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2048\" data-start=\"1970\">\r\n<p data-end=\"2048\" data-start=\"1972\">Selling 100 items per day could generate approximately <strong data-end=\"2046\" data-start=\"2026\">$4,200 per month</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2116\" data-start=\"2049\">\r\n<p data-end=\"2116\" data-start=\"2051\">Scaling to 200 items per day may yield over <strong data-end=\"2114\" data-start=\"2094\">$8,400 per month</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-end=\"2318\" data-start=\"2118\">Our mobile model minimizes overhead costs and allows flexibility in location, making it an efficient and scalable business with long-term potential for expansion &mdash; both in product range and in impact.</p>\r\n</div>",
